# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""The words of /trader/ — «مسیر تریدر»: four levels of trader, one answer (entry, risk, target).

Owner's brief (2026-11-26): think as a trader at every level, beginner to super-professional; each level has its own
words and its own checks, but every one of them ends at the same place: where to enter, with what risk and to what
target. Free for everyone (the site is non-profit).

This file holds only text and structure; scripts/build_trader.py renders it and assets/trader/trader.js is the plan
calculator every level ends with. Every link points at a page the site already has (tests/test_trader.py checks them
against the menu), so the path ties the existing tools together instead of copying them.

Rules for the text: educational, no buy/sell call, no promise of profit; a number shown as data comes from the site's
own data files or from the visitor's own inputs.
"""


